WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:07.350
Speaker 1: Today, I am joined by James Cromwell,
actor, activist producer, whose new film Mondo

00:00:07.350 --> 00:00:14.209
Hollywood Land, follows a politically confused
mushrooms dealer who traverses through Hollywood,

00:00:14.209 --> 00:00:16.530
available now on Amazon Prime Video.

00:00:16.530 --> 00:00:18.010
James, so great to have you on.

00:00:18.010 --> 00:00:19.410
I really appreciate it.

00:00:19.410 --> 00:00:20.600
Thank you.

00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:25.290
So talk to us a little bit about this, this
film which you produced.

00:00:25.290 --> 00:00:26.290
What?

00:00:26.290 --> 00:00:28.710
What was the genesis of the idea here?

00:00:28.710 --> 00:00:36.210
Speaker 6: The genesis of the idea was that
maybe it made him easier for him to sell the

00:00:36.210 --> 00:00:37.210
film.

00:00:37.210 --> 00:00:43.260
