which matters a lot, which matter.

00:00:43.260 --> 00:00:44.350
It's not a small issue.

00:00:44.350 --> 00:00:45.690
Speaker 6: No, it is not.

00:00:45.690 --> 00:00:48.560
That's not if you want your film to be seen.

00:00:48.560 --> 00:00:54.570
