could still be more substantive.

00:03:19.590 --> 00:03:24.780
But even that in order to make the film appealing,
is is kept relatively superficial.

00:03:24.780 --> 00:03:27.409
So you really have two layers of this that
you're fighting against.

00:03:27.409 --> 00:03:32.120
