00:03:46.590 --> 00:03:51.700
Are we insane who runs the show?

00:03:51.700 --> 00:03:54.709
What can we do as individuals to oppose it?

00:03:54.709 --> 00:04:01.470
What is the cost of living in a dysfunctional
